 The workspace provides a separated area for each tenant's data and configurations.

b. LOGO and copyright information: In the process of using osbi-net's frontend, you may not remove or modify the LOGO or copyright information in the osbi-net console or applications. This restriction is inapplicable to uses of osbi-net that do not involve its frontend.

    - Frontend Definition: For the purposes of this license, the "frontend" of osbi-net includes all components located in the `web/` directory when running osbi-net from the raw source code, or the "web" image when running osbi-net with Docker.

