d. Prohibited usage: Using osbi-net for any unlawful or unauthorized scraping, including activities that violate applicable laws, website terms of service, or robots exclusion directives.

e. Prohibited usage: Using osbi-net to obtain, copy, or distribute content from media platforms and trading platforms or other materials protected by third-party intellectual property rights, unless you have obtained prior explicit authorization from the rights holder.

